ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a technology innovation competition, Wang Ming and Yang Hui are the team leaders of two competing teams. As the competition goes to the end, Yang Hui's team presents a technology product, which receives mixed reviews from the jury. Wang Ming looks at Yang Hui's smugness and says, \"This innovation of yours probably comes from a masterpiece left over from the last century.\"\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Wang Ming say this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Wang Ming mocks Yang Hui because he thinks the work of Yang Hui's team is not innovative.\nB. Wang Ming mocks Yang Hui because he thinks the technology innovation competition is not worth participating in.\nC. Wang Ming wants to praise the work of Yang Hui's team is very good.\nD. Wang Ming wants to praise Yang Hui for leading the entire team very well.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0010322136765302501,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e2c3d6006945d280369a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368195366,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:36:35","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"7a50e2ff2cf24ca3b962a78c6662a985"}